---
/** Wraps a row of <Choice> cards. Replaces the Jekyll `.selector-grid` markup. */
---

<div class="choice-grid"><slot /></div>

<style>
	.choice-grid {
		display: grid;
		/* Capped rather than 1fr so a lone card stays card-sized instead of
		   stretching across the whole row. */
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(11rem, 14rem));
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 1rem;
		margin-block: 1.5rem;
	}
</style>
